+# E7 — Conservation–Viability Coupling (F1 + F3)
+
+## E7.Thm1 — Moiety-barrier production rules — PROVEN
+
+(a) Balanced-budget inner: `{q_L ≥ D_T} ⊆ Viab_T({q_L ≥ 0})`.
